{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;You were chosen by the high council. You'll be sent to hell with our best equipment. Your mission: kill the devil. Fail us not!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROFANA is a metroidvania where you control a little angel on a sacred mission to kill the Devil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THIS SATANICAL HELL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After losing your wings and equipment upon entering hell, you will have to cross it on foot. You will explore from deserts to cyberpunk cities to fulfill your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/357c7502b55c30d2a4b1f3b1c38c1622.poster.avif?t=1761142575\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/357c7502b55c30d2a4b1f3b1c38c1622.webm?t=1761142575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/357c7502b55c30d2a4b1f3b1c38c1622.mp4?t=1761142575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND DELICIOUS WEAPONS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout this hell, you will find from spears and swords to firearms and familiars, each with unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/38959362f0e20f56aeb1260b69b95ec6.poster.avif?t=1761142575\" width=780 height=71 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/38959362f0e20f56aeb1260b69b95ec6.webm?t=1761142575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET READY, BECAUSE YOU WILL BE MAKING ASS KICKING COMBOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon type has its own moveset. Don't repeat attacks, rank up, and finish them off with powerful magic, you'll see the lives of these demons melt before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/bb0c5d46cc3878b1f73fcd04096efc3d.poster.avif?t=1761142575\" width=638 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/bb0c5d46cc3878b1f73fcd04096efc3d.webm?t=1761142575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/bb0c5d46cc3878b1f73fcd04096efc3d.mp4?t=1761142575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?! TEAR UP THIS HELL ON A MOTORCYCLE AND DESTROY THE DEVIL IN...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/extras/5bfced8d6b32a5d5e681dd2f7c23ce7b.avif?t=1761142575\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525610?t=1761142575","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/c89f486775ead618eddf3d2fdd80a81ae5b42bf5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761142575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525610/efa6a16a0ee5844c2e47ad560a18b6c94c888740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761142575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.aka